        "text": "A short par 4 that runs downhill, with a choice straight away. A long drive can get close, but the fairway pinches in where it lands and pines crowd both sides. The safer play is a shorter tee shot, leaving a full short iron between the greenside bunkers to a green that slopes down from the front.",
