        "text": "An unusual dogleg right, with the shorter leg first. Big hitters can cut the corner over the pines, close to the out-of-bounds fence. The second shot goes straight up a gentle slope along a narrow, pine-lined fairway, past a bunker on the right about 95 m out, to a green with a bunker on each side of its entrance.",
